   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY26",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "The London sales market remains challenging, with buyer demand in early 2026 continuing to be held back by weak consumer confidence. To manage this, the Group is focused on repositioning the Sales business for these lower volume market conditions to accelerate the path to profitability.",
